---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy" description="How Easy Garden Plan collects, uses, and protects your information.">
  <article class="page-shell py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="display-title mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold">Your garden is private.</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">Last updated September 25, 2026</p>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 leading-7 text-muted">
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Information we use</h2><p class="mt-3">We store your account details and the information needed to make your plan: your private garden location, bed shapes, crops, schedules, progress, and notification choices. If you subscribe, we store the billing status needed to provide Pro. Stripe processes payment-card information; Easy Garden Plan does not store full card details.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Services that help make your plan</h2><p class="mt-3">We may send the minimum information needed to Geoapify for address lookup, MapTiler for map tiles, the National Weather Service for forecasts and alerts, Resend for email delivery, and Stripe for billing. Crop research does not include your address or garden geometry.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Security and logs</h2><p class="mt-3">Operational logs are designed to exclude exact coordinates, street addresses, email content, passwords, payment details, and provider secrets. We use account and household boundaries to keep one gardener from reading another gardener’s data.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Your choices and deletion</h2><p class="mt-3">You can change alert preferences or cancel Pro from your account. Account deletion removes your household, garden, plans, progress, notification history, pending work, and local billing record before removing the account. Payment and delivery providers may retain records when law or fraud prevention requires it.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Questions</h2><p class="mt-3">Email <a class="font-semibold text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:privacy@easygardenplan.com">privacy@easygardenplan.com</a> with a privacy question or request.</p></section>
    </div>
  </div></article>
</SiteLayout>
